{
  "id": "editorial",
  "name": "Editorial",
  "description": "The explainer cut: a calm serif, captions lower left in sentence case with a marker sweeping under each word as it is said, a slow push into every shot, titles that rise and settle, a bar for who is talking, warm paper tones with a little grain. Nothing shouts; the story carries it.",
  "bestFor": "A lecture, an interview, a history or a how-it-works piece.",
